"""A user config's `test.include` is written for the sources, `**/*.test.ts`;
the compiled `.js` the launcher hands vitest match none of it. The attribute
layer's `include` names the compiled test files, so the run is the rule's srcs
whatever the config's globs say."""

load("//ts:defs.bzl", "ts_test")

# keep
ts_test(
    name = "config_include_test",
    srcs = ["include.test.ts"],
    config = "vitest.config.mjs",
    node_modules = "//tests/npm:node_modules",
    deps = ["@npm//:vitest"],
)
